      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
